WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.000
Stitch an even chain and secure its last loop.

00:00:04.000 --> 00:00:09.500
Bring up contrasting thread beside the first loop.
Slide a blunt needle under both strands, above the cloth.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.800
Wrap the thread over the chain to reach the next loop.
Pass the needle underneath from the same side.

00:00:14.800 --> 00:00:20.000
Repeat with one wrap per loop.
Pull gently so the chain stays flat.

00:00:20.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Take the needle down beside the last loop
and secure the thread on the back.
